<title>UK: LIFFE COCOA, COFFEE END MIXED, SUGAR HIGHER.</title>
<headline>LIFFE COCOA, COFFEE END MIXED, SUGAR HIGHER.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Ends tightly mixed after quiet afternoon. September one stg higher at 1,022 stg.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Ends mixed with front months higher. September $15 up at $1,630.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Moves higher on bullish NY sentiment after bouncing off $320.00 support on October. $2.40 higher at $322.50 at 1604 GMT.</p>
</text>
